Here are the fixes for the database schema mismatches (camelCase vs snake_case) and the Row-Level Security (RLS) policy violations.

### **1. SQL Update (Fixing RLS Errors)**
The "new row violates row-level security policy" error happens because the previous policies restricted access to `authenticated` users only. Since your app uses custom PIN authentication instead of Supabase Auth, we need to allow `public` access to the tables so the app can function with the standard API key.

Run this in your **Supabase SQL Editor**:

```sql
-- 1. Drop strict authenticated policies
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.store_settings;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.users;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.clients;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.products;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.transactions;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.appointments;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.discounts;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.logs;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.devices;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.sms_tracker;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.product_categories;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.service_categories;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.template_history;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow auth access" ON public.messages;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow authenticated access" ON public.messages;

-- 2. Create public policies (Allows custom auth logic to work)
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.store_settings FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.users FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.clients FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.products FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.transactions FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
