CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.discounts FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.logs FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.devices FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.sms_tracker FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.product_categories FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.service_categories FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.template_history FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow public access" ON public.messages FOR ALL TO public USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
```

### **2. Code Update (Fixing Column Name Errors)**
I am updating `StoreContext.tsx` to correctly map your JavaScript variables (e.g., `contactNumber`) to the database columns (e.g., `contact_number`) for Settings, Devices, and Logs.

